                <div class="help-section">
                    <h2 class="help-section-title">Steps to parse and download videos</h2>
                    <p>1. Copy the video link of the video that you would like to download.</p>
                    <p>2. Paste the video link into the text box on the homepage.</p>
                    <p>3. Wait while our servers process the video and generate download links for you.</p>
                    <p>4. Once we successfully generate the download links you can click on the version of the video you'd like to save. Click the download button, press the right mouse button and select save video as.</p>
